# Dev-only apt packages (Debian/Ubuntu).
# Installed by `make venv` when EXTRAS includes `dev`, and by
# `make apt-deps APT_PROFILE=dev`.

# Intentionally EMPTY: the profile exists for a future dev-only OS package, and
# `make apt-deps APT_PROFILE=dev` prints "nothing to install" until there is one.
#
# `shellcheck` used to live here as a fallback for the shell-lint gate. The gate now requires the
# pinned `shellcheck-py` wheel from the `dev` extra (.venv/bin/shellcheck) and no longer falls back
# to a PATH binary, because a distro shellcheck is releases behind the pin and reaches a different
# verdict on the same commit. Nothing apt provides is needed for it.
